      <p>Currently, the following projects are assigned to reviewers. These reviews will be published in forthcoming issues of RIDE. Please see this page for further <ref target="https://ride.i-d-e.de/reviewers/suggested-projects-for-review/">suggestions for review</ref>.</p>
      <div>
