          <item>The Elizabeth Gaskell Journal: Digital Edition (<ref target="https://elizabethgaskelljournal.com/index.html">https://elizabethgaskelljournal.com/index.html</ref>)</item>
          <item>FMB correspondence (<ref target="https://www.felix-mendelssohn-bartholdy.org/">https://www.felix-mendelssohn-bartholdy.org/</ref>)</item>
          <item>Frankenstein. A Digital Variorum Edition (<ref target="https://frankensteinvariorum.org/">https://frankensteinvariorum.org/</ref>)</item>
          <item><ref target="https://edition.mgh.de/001">Ulrich Richental: Die Chronik des Konzils von Konstanz (Monumenta Germaniae Historica)</ref></item>
          <item><ref target="https://jjda.ie/main/JJDA/JJDAhome.htm">James Joyce Digital Archive</ref></item>
        </list>
      </div>
      <div>
